  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO Nigeria Portfolio Monitoring Evaluation and Learning Implementation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Portfolio Monitoring, Evaluation and Learning programme (PMEL) will give FCDO Nigeria a mechanism to provide answers to questions at a portfolio level. This evidence will inform the strategic management of all HMG resources used in Nigeria. PMEL will take a whole-of-mission view to understand the impact of our combined efforts towards development objectives.</narrative>
  </description>
